.SH NAME
kc-vault - Manage vaults (service groups)


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBkc vault [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Vaults group secrets under a Keychain service prefix (kc:{name}).


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for vault


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--vault\fP=""
	target vault (overrides active vault)


